# Course materials — TUM lecture content, not ours to redistribute (PLAN.md D13).
# ~495 MB, mostly MP4 recordings. Keep out of git entirely; document provenance in
# corpus/manifest.yml instead, and describe how to obtain the material in README.md.
corpus/

# Run outputs: JSONL logs, SQLite pools, vector indexes
data/

# Gradle / Java
.gradle/
build/
bin/
out/
*.class

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Local config that may hold credentials (Logos / Azure / Pyris tokens).
# Matched in any location. Note these files are profile-specific and are NOT read unless the matching
# profile is activated -- see README.md section 4. They are ignored because they MAY hold credentials,
# not because Spring loads them by default.
**/application-local.yml
**/application-local.yaml
**/*-local.yml
**/*-local.yaml
*.env
.env
# Ollama/Logos credential files. NOTE: the *.env rule above does NOT match ".logos-env",
# because that name ends in "-env" rather than ".env". Match it explicitly, anywhere in the tree.
.logos-env
**/.logos-env
*-env

# Run artefacts cited in the thesis notes. Kept out of the repository because a run record
# carries the full prompt text, which embeds verbatim lecture material (see corpus/ above).
evidence/
